**Chris's Philosophy: Remove ALL barriers**

"Awesome! Okay, here's everything you need to know:

📍 Sixteen-fifty Industry Drive, east side of Indy
⏰ Office hours: Monday through Friday eight-thirty to eight, weekends ten to three
💰 Fifteen bucks drop-in, or twenty-nine per month unlimited - most people just do the pass
