**Chris's Approach: Be honest, point to humans**

"You know what, that's a good question and I want to make sure you get the RIGHT answer.

Best bet:
- Call during office hours: three-one-seven, nine-eight-one, four-oh-six-four
- Email Jaci, our Director of Pickleball: jaci at indianapolispickleballclub dot com
- Or leave me your contact info and I'll have someone follow up?"

